msgid "Chain Pedal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:6
msgid ""
"PedalChain is the helper class for Chain Pedal devices on the Chain bus. "
"It provides access to the physical pedal state, logical switch state, "
"event callbacks, work modes, and the four RGB LEDs."
msgstr ""
"PedalChain 是 Chain 总线上 Chain Pedal 设备的辅助类。它提供对物理踏板状态、逻辑开关状态、事件回调、工作模式及 4 "
"个 RGB LED 的访问。"

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:10
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:12
msgid "|Chain Pedal|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:15
msgid "Product Features"
msgstr "产品特性"

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:17
msgid "Read the physical pedal state or the latched logical switch state."
msgstr "读取物理踏板状态或锁存的逻辑开关状态。"

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:18
msgid ""
"Use single-click mode or switch mode, and receive click or status-change "
"callbacks when event reporting is enabled."
msgstr "使用单击模式或开关模式，并在启用事件上报时接收单击或状态变化回调。"

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:20
msgid ""
"Control four RGB LEDs independently and select which LEDs show the pedal "
"event overlay."
msgstr "独立控制 4 个 RGB LED，并选择显示踏板事件叠加效果的 LED。"

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:22
msgid ""
"Configure how long the pedal must be held to enter local configuration "
"mode."
msgstr "配置踏板需持续踩下多长时间才能进入本地配置模式。"

#: ../../source/chain/pedal.rst:23
msgid ""
"Optionally save the work mode, configuration-entry time, RGB overlay "
"mask, and RGB brightness to flash."
msgstr "可选择将工作模式、进入配置模式的时间、RGB 叠加掩码和 RGB 亮度保存到 Flash。"

